<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Order List — Mastex Catalog</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css">
<script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

<%- include("partials/header", {mark:"MX", wordmark:true, title:"Order List", tagline:"For Mastex", search:"", kbd:false}) %>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Your order list</h1>
  <p>Items you've added across any vendor page, combined into one list. Adjust quantities below, then export it as a CSV or copy it as plain text to send to Mastex.</p>
</div>

<div class="banner">
  <div class="banner-inner">
    <span>🛒</span>
    <span>This cart is real (saved on the server, so it's the same on every PC), but "sending to Mastex" just exports a file or copies text — there's no order-submission backend yet.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap" id="wrap"></div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script src="/js/cart.js"></script>
<script src="/js/favorites-badge.js"></script>
<script src="/js/cart-page.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
